  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle and add the boiling water and salt to a large saucepan (or bring a saucepan of salted water to the boil).\n• Cook farfalle in boiling water, stirring occasionally, until ‘al dente’, 10 mins. Drain."
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, roughly chop tomato.\n• Trim green beans and cut into thirds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60078f450f8b7b36fb70ccb7/step-cc4233de.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a drizzle of olive oil in a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Add tomato and green beans and cook, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, 4-6 mins.\n• Stir in cream, garlic seasoning and crumbled vegetable stock (1 cube for 2P / 2 cubes for 4P). Cook for 1 min.\n• Add pasta and cheese to the pan. Cook, tossing, until melted, 1 min. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60078f450f8b7b36fb70ccb7/step-a75f90a8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, in a medium bowl, combine a small drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper. Add mixed salad leaves and toss to combine.\n• Divide creamy tomato farfalle between bowls. Serve with salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/60078f450f8b7b36fb70ccb7/step-e0ea2139.jpg"
    }
  ]
